      "title": "Catatan QC: 983 zero-GPS & datum stabil",
      "content_markdown": "### Temuan QC\n- `sat=00` + koordinat nol: magnetik tetap valid, flag `INVALID_POSITION/MISSING_GPS`.\n- Datum `/datum 45000.00` + SN Base 41210241 stabil semua hari.\n- CRS terkunci UTM 50S (EPSG:32750), deviasi 0.02 m vs WGS84; QC `CRS_MISMATCH` bila > 1 m.\n- SQ legacy: 69/79/89/99 lolos; opsi konservatif `min >= 90`.",
